  "prefLabel": "Res 5901.06 Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5901.06 Burden of Proof. If a person who meets the requirements of an enhanced penalty shall deny any facts relating to the convictions of offenses used to assess points, then the person shall have the burden of proving that such is untrue.\n\nSource. #10547, eff 3-21-14\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res5200-5900.html"
